{"game": "aliens-fireteam-elite", "language": "english", "appid": 1549970, "month": "2023-02", "window": 1, "start_date": 1675209600, "end_date": 1675814399, "month_true_total": 146, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-04 02:21:35 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "132384995", "author": {"steamid": "76561197980336587", "personaname": "Adolf", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Ad-olf/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 16, "playtime_forever": 4806, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4030, "last_played": 1722080423, "avatar": "f4786a2e9f3d9ad481b6cf7d274d50f8f3d18db9"}, "language": "english", "review": "The good:\nLots of customization: Classes, perks, tons of weapons and attachments. Armor, helmet and player character.\n3 Player co-op.\nMore game mods.\nMore alien lore to collect.\nAlien soundtrack.\n\nThe bad:\nBugs. (AI stuck on walls, network disconnects, game crashes). Because of this hardcore mode is unplayable.\nWhen you or your teammate disconnect it will not let you join in the game and will not let anyone else join in.\nWeak story. \nMediocre graphics.\nThe replay value is low, because of how linear the maps are. There are no map variants.\nThe devs do not communicate with players.\nThe campaign is very short.\nNo PvP.\nNo communication allowed in the game.\nIs not scary as alien universe should be.\n\nI would not recommend unless it is for 10-15 euro.\n\n\n", "timestamp_created": 1675796544, "timestamp_updated": 1675796544, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.54761505126953125", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "132382164", "author": {"steamid": "76561198253709008", "personaname": "bizarro", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/VortexMdl/", "num_games_owned": 64, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 2973, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1342, "last_played": 1682563791, "avatar": "41efc1fed0925bbcacb6334ddcf7b24ba53dd843"}, "language": "english", "review": "Left 4 Dead but it's Aliens.", "timestamp_created": 1675792698, "timestamp_updated": 1675792698, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.513319671154022217", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "132378109", "author": {"steamid": "76561198042015777", "personaname": "Rotzblase", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198042015777/", "num_games_owned": 1907, "num_reviews": 18, "playtime_forever": 1538, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1538, "last_played": 1675786548, "avatar": "da09c36b9252acd704e35b9b6163cb5b33891dae"}, "language": "english", "review": "I would give a neutral valuation, because I still played it for around 25 hours. Still so many annoying Bugs. You can have your fun for about the Time I played, but only if you can handle it from time to time to hear the Weopon from your Teammate constantly firing for a whole level. Or you don't hear your gun firing at all. \n\nThe Bug with the stuck xenos is apperently fixed with the update that just came out. Too bad I'm done with the game.", "timestamp_created": 1675787215, "timestamp_updated": 1675787215, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.480922102928161621", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid